    `s 8 the number of days by which the contract's term on the length of notice is void as shorter than section 10(3)` `the days of notice my contract says` (`s 10(3) the least number of days of notice` (`Dates of the employment` WITH `began on` IS `the day my employment began`, `ended on` IS NOTHING) `the day the notice is given` `I work under a contract of service`) `the shorter notice is less favourable to me`

-- s 10(2).  A contract may fix the length of notice; the least under section 10(3) governs when it is longer.
