    `s 10(2) the length of the notice, in days` (`my amount if I know it` `the days of notice my contract says`) (`s 10(3) the least number of days of notice` (`Dates of the employment` WITH `began on` IS `the day my employment began`, `ended on` IS NOTHING) `the day the notice is given` `I work under a contract of service`)

