GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 30(3), is the deduction subject to conditions the Commissioner may impose` IS
    `s 30(3) the deduction is subject to conditions that the Commissioner may impose` (`my kind of deduction in the section's words` `which deduction`)

-- s 31.  Situation: asked only of a person who owes an advance or a loan.
@export Under section 31(1), may my employer start recovering an advance made before I began work from this payment of salary?
GIVEN `the advance was made before my contract of service began` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the advance of money made to you before your contract of service began?
      `this is my first payment for a completed salary period` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is this the first payment of salary you receive for a completed salary period?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 31(1), may my employer start recovering the advance from this payment` IS
    `s 31(1) the recovery of the advance may begin with the payment` `the advance was made before my contract of service began` `this is my first payment for a completed salary period`

@export Under section 31(1), may my employer recover an advance that was made for my travelling expenses?
GIVEN `the advance was made before my contract of service began` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the advance of money made to you before your contract of service began?
      `the advance was for travelling expenses` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the advance made for travelling expenses?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 31(1), may my employer recover an advance made for my travelling expenses` IS
    `s 31(1) the advance may be recovered` `the advance was made before my contract of service began` `the advance was for travelling expenses`

@export Under section 31(2), is my advance being recovered over a permitted number of months?
GIVEN `the months over which the deductions are spread` IS A NUMBER @desc Over how many months are the deductions from your salary spread?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 31(2), is my advance being recovered over a permitted number of months` IS
    `s 31(2) the advance is recovered in instalments within the permitted spread` `the months over which the deductions are spread`

@export Under section 31(3), what is the most that may be deducted from my salary in one instalment of an advance, in dollars?
