GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 31(4), may the loan be recovered in instalments by deductions from my salary` IS
    `s 31(4) the loan may be recovered in instalments by deductions from salary` `the sum is a loan to me`

@export Under section 31(5), what is the most that may be deducted from my salary in one instalment of a loan, in dollars?
