      `the hours of overtime I have worked in the month` IS A NUMBER @desc How many hours of overtime have you worked in the month?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 38(5), may my employer permit me to work this much overtime in the month` IS
    `if Part 4 applies to me, the yes or no` (`Part 4 applies to me from what I say` `I am a workman` `I am employed in a managerial or an executive position` `my basic pay for a month` `my commissions for a month`) (`s 38(5) the employee may be permitted to work the overtime in the month` `the hours of overtime I have worked in the month`)

-- s 38(6).
