    `if Part 4 applies to me, the number` (`Part 4 applies to me from what I say` `I am a workman` `I am employed in a managerial or an executive position` `my basic pay for a month` `my commissions for a month`) (`s 38(6) the hourly basic rate of pay for calculating the payment due for overtime` (`my amount if I know it` `my hourly basic rate of pay`))

-- s 38(8).
