    `if Part 4 applies to me, the number` (`Part 4 applies to me from what I say` `I am a workman` `I am employed in a managerial or an executive position` `my basic pay for a month` `my commissions for a month`) (`s 40(1) the limit of hours in one week` (`s 40(1) section 40 applies to the employee` `I am engaged under my contract in regular shift work` `I have otherwise consented in writing to the hours of work in section 40`))

-- s 40(1).
@export Under section 40(1), is the average number of hours I work per week over the 3 weeks within the limit?
