      `I am employed in a managerial or an executive position` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you employed in a managerial or an executive position?
      `my basic pay for a month` IS A NUMBER @desc What is your basic pay for a month, in dollars, before overtime and bonuses?
      `my commissions for a month` IS A NUMBER @desc What commissions do you earn in a month, in dollars?
