      `I was told the number of working days in each week` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you informed of the number of working days in each week?
      `I was told my weekly rest day` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you informed of the weekly rest day?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
