      `my employer set up a fund that safeguards my benefits` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has your employer set up a fund under a scheme for pensions, gratuities, provident fund or other superannuation benefits, by which employees' benefits are safeguarded if the employer is bankrupt or wound up, ceases business or transfers the undertaking or property?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
