    `if Part 4 applies to me, the yes or no` (`Part 4 applies to me from what I say` `I am a workman` `I am employed in a managerial or an executive position` `my basic pay for a month` `my commissions for a month`) (`s 47(2) the collective agreement or award is deemed to contain the provision that the employee must be paid` `a collective agreement or an award provides for a gratuity or other sum on my retirement` `it makes no provision for a sum if my employer ceases business or transfers the undertaking` `my employer has ceased business or transferred the undertaking or property` `I have ceased to be employed because of that` ((`s 47(3) subsection (2) applies` `my employer set up a fund that safeguards my benefits`) EQUALS JUST FALSE))

