      `the amount actually paid to me in legal tender` IS A NUMBER @desc What amount, in dollars, was actually paid to you in legal tender?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 56, has the entire amount of my salary been paid in legal tender` IS
    `s 56 the entire amount of the salary has been actually paid in legal tender` `the salary I earned or is payable to me` `the amount actually paid to me in legal tender`

-- s 56.
@export Under section 56, is a payment made to me in a form other than legal tender illegal and void?
GIVEN `I am a workman` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a workman (a person doing manual labour, and the other kinds the Act names)?
      `the payment is made in a form other than legal tender` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the payment made in a form other than legal tender?
      `the Act expressly permits that form` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Employment Act expressly permit the payment in that form?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 56, is the payment illegal and void` IS
    `s 56 the payment is illegal and void` `I am a workman` `the payment is made in a form other than legal tender` `the Act expressly permits that form`

-- s 57.
@export Under section 57, what amount of salary am I entitled to recover, in dollars?
GIVEN `I am a workman` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a workman (a person doing manual labour, and the other kinds the Act names)?
      `the salary I earned` IS A NUMBER @desc What salary, in dollars, did you earn?
      `the sums lawfully deducted under this Act` IS A NUMBER @desc What sums, in dollars, were lawfully deducted in accordance with the provisions of the Employment Act?
      `the amount actually paid to me in legal tender` IS A NUMBER @desc What amount, in dollars, was actually paid to you in legal tender?
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 57, what amount of salary am I entitled to recover` IS
    `s 57 the amount of salary the workman is entitled to recover` `I am a workman` `the salary I earned` `the sums lawfully deducted under this Act` `the amount actually paid to me in legal tender`

-- s 58.
@export Under section 58, may my employer make a deduction by way of interest on an advance of my salary?
GIVEN `the deduction is by way of discount, interest or any similar charge on an advance of my salary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the deduction by way of discount, interest or any similar charge on account of an advance of salary made to you as a workman?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 58, may my employer make a deduction for interest on an advance of my salary` IS
    `s 58 the employer may make the deduction` `the deduction is by way of discount, interest or any similar charge on an advance of my salary`

-- s 59.
@export Under section 59, does this Part make my contract of service illegal because it gives me food, quarters or other privileges in addition to money salary?
GIVEN `my contract gives me food, quarters or other allowances or privileges in addition to money salary as remuneration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your contract of service, as a workman, for giving you food, quarters or other allowances or privileges in addition to money salary as remuneration for your services?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 59, does this Part render my contract of service illegal` IS
    `s 59 this Part renders the contract of service illegal` `my contract gives me food, quarters or other allowances or privileges in addition to money salary as remuneration`

-- s 59.
@export Under section 59, may my employer give me noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor as remuneration?
GIVEN `the thing given is noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing given to you by way of remuneration noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 59, may my employer give me the thing as remuneration` IS
    `s 59 the employer may give the workman the thing by way of remuneration` `the thing given is noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor`

-- s 60(1).
@export Under section 60(1), does this Part prevent my employer from establishing a shop or canteen?
GIVEN `my employer established or permitted a shop or canteen for foodstuffs, provisions, meals or refreshments` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has your employer established, or permitted to be established, a shop or canteen for the sale of foodstuffs, provisions, meals or refreshments?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 60(1), does this Part prevent my employer from establishing the shop or canteen` IS
    `s 60(1) this Part prevents the employer from establishing or permitting the shop or canteen` `my employer established or permitted a shop or canteen for foodstuffs, provisions, meals or refreshments`

-- s 60(1).
@export Under section 60(1), may I be compelled by my contract of service to buy goods at the shop or canteen?
GIVEN `my contract compels me to buy goods at the shop or canteen` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your contract of service compel you to purchase goods at the shop or canteen?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 60(1), may I be compelled to buy goods at the shop or canteen` IS
    `s 60(1) the workman may be compelled by a contract of service to purchase goods at the shop or canteen` `my contract compels me to buy goods at the shop or canteen`

-- s 60(1).
@export Under section 60(1), may noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor be sold at the shop or canteen?
GIVEN `the thing sold is noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing sold at the shop or canteen noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 60(1), may noxious drugs and intoxicating liquor be sold at the shop or canteen` IS
    `s 60(1) noxious drugs and intoxicating liquor may be sold at the shop or canteen` `the thing sold is noxious drugs or intoxicating liquor`

-- s 60(2).
@export Under section 60(2), may my employer keep a shop or canteen at my place of employment otherwise than as section 60(1) allows?
GIVEN `it is a shop or canteen at my place of employment for the sale of foodstuffs, provisions, meals or refreshments to the employer's workmen` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a shop or canteen on your place of employment for the sale of foodstuffs, provisions, meals or refreshments to the employer's workmen?
      `it is established or kept otherwise than as section 60(1) allows` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it established or kept otherwise than in accordance with section 60(1)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 60(2), may my employer establish or keep the shop or canteen` IS
    `s 60(2) the employer may establish or keep the shop or canteen` `it is a shop or canteen at my place of employment for the sale of foodstuffs, provisions, meals or refreshments to the employer's workmen` `it is established or kept otherwise than as section 60(1) allows`

-- s 61.
@export Under section 61, is my employer guilty of an offence against Part 5?
GIVEN `my employer made a contract or gave remuneration contrary to Part 5` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has your employer entered into a contract of service, or given remuneration for service, contrary to the provisions of Part 5 or declared by Part 5 to be illegal?
      `my employer received a payment from a workman contrary to Part 5` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has your employer received a payment from a workman contrary to the provisions of Part 5?
      `my employer contravened section 60(2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has your employer contravened section 60(2)?
