    `s 61 the employer is guilty of an offence` `my employer made a contract or gave remuneration contrary to Part 5` `my employer received a payment from a workman contrary to Part 5` `my employer contravened section 60(2)`

-- s 61.
@export Under section 61, what is the penalty on my employer on conviction?
