    `s 61 the penalty on conviction` `my employer is guilty of an offence under section 61` `it is a second or subsequent offence`

-- s 63(1).
@export Under section 63(1), do sections 54 and 56 make the payment of my salary into my account or by cheque unlawful or invalid?
GIVEN `my salary is paid into a bank account in Singapore in my name or jointly` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your salary paid into an account at a bank in Singapore in your name or jointly with one or more other persons?
      `my salary is paid by cheque payable to me or to my order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your salary paid by cheque made payable to you or to your order?
