-- s 63(2).
@export Under section 63(2), what amount of salary do I have a right to recover under section 57, in dollars?
GIVEN `I am a workman` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a workman (a person doing manual labour, and the other kinds the Act names)?
      `the salary I earned` IS A NUMBER @desc What salary, in dollars, did you earn?
      `the sums lawfully deducted under this Act` IS A NUMBER @desc What sums, in dollars, were lawfully deducted in accordance with the provisions of the Employment Act?
      `the amount actually paid to me in legal tender` IS A NUMBER @desc What amount, in dollars, was actually paid to you in legal tender?
