    `s 63(2) the amount of salary the workman has a right of recovery of under section 57` (`s 57 the amount of salary the workman is entitled to recover` `I am a workman` `the salary I earned` `the sums lawfully deducted under this Act` `the amount actually paid to me in legal tender`) `the part of my salary paid into my account or by cheque`

-- s 64.
@export Under section 64, does Part 5 apply to a body of persons working on an agreement of cooperation that I belong to?
