    `s 76(4) the female employee is entitled to payment under subsection (1A) for the confinement` `the living children I have at the time of the confinement` `the previous confinements during which those children were born` `a collective agreement or award provides to the contrary` `I belong to a class of employees the Minister has specified by notification in the Gazette`

