    `s 87A(7A) the employer is guilty of an offence` `my employer failed to grant me childcare leave that I am entitled to and requested` `my employer had reasonable cause`

-- s 87A(7B).  A fine not exceeding $5,000 or 6 months or both; for a repeat offender, $10,000, 12 months, or both.
@export Under section 87A(7B), what is the penalty on an employer convicted under section 87A(7) or (7A)?
GIVEN `the employer is a repeat offender` IS A `ea2 seat: my answer` @desc Has the employer already been convicted of such an offence in the way section 87A(7C) describes?
