@export Under section 114, may the Commissioner compound an offence by accepting a sum from me?
GIVEN `the offence is one prescribed as an offence which may be compounded` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the offence is one prescribed as an offence which may be compounded?
      `the person is reasonably suspected of committing the offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the case that the person is reasonably suspected of committing the offence?
      `the sum offered in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc Please give the number for this: the sum offered in dollars.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
